<title>GERMANY: German Garant Schuh shares priced at 128 marks.</title>
<headline>German Garant Schuh shares priced at 128 marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>New shares in German retailer Garant Schuh AG will be offered for sale at 128 marks each from September 9 prior to their planned listing on September 11, lead manager DG Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that 36,000 preference shares, without voting rights, would be on offer. Their total nominal value was 1.8 million marks.</p>
<p>The price was well below the 177 marks book value of the shares, DG Bank said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
